INSERT INTO `assessment_result` VALUES (1,9,100,'Software Developer',100,'Strong foundational knowledge in software development concepts.,Excellent understanding of backend and database-oriented principles.,Aptitude for quickly grasping technical and historical aspects of programming.','Practical application and project development experience.,In-depth knowledge of data structures and algorithms.,Proficiency in specific programming languages and frameworks.,Understanding of version control systems (e.g., Git).,Exposure to frontend technologies or cloud computing concepts.','The student demonstrates an exceptional understanding of core software development and backend concepts, achieving a perfect score on the assessment. This indicates a strong aptitude and foundational knowledge suitable for a career in software development, particularly within backend systems or database-related roles. To advance, the student should focus on applying theoretical knowledge through practical projects, building a robust portfolio, and continuously expanding their skill set in key development areas.','2026-08-10 10:29:34',NULL),(2,9,100,'Software Developer',92,'Demonstrated proficiency in core programming languages like Python and C.,Strong foundational understanding of database-oriented languages essential for backend systems.,Excellent aptitude for technical concepts, reflected by a perfect assessment score.,Grasping of fundamental software development categories, specifically Backend principles.','Mastering Data Structures and Algorithms for efficient problem-solving.,Proficiency in version control systems like Git for collaborative development.,Developing expertise in a web framework (e.g., Django or Flask for Python).,In-depth knowledge of SQL and Database Management Systems for complex data interactions.','Based on your exceptional assessment performance, demonstrating a perfect score and a strong grasp of foundational programming languages like Python and C, along with a keen understanding of database concepts crucial for backend systems, you are exceptionally well-suited for a career as a Software Developer. Your aptitude suggests you have the potential to excel in building robust and scalable software solutions, particularly within backend development.','2026-08-10 10:40:04',NULL),(3,9,100,'Software Developer',95,'Strong foundational programming knowledge (demonstrated by understanding of C language),Proficiency in Python, a versatile and widely used programming language,Understanding of backend concepts, specifically database-oriented languages,High aptitude for technical subjects, indicated by a perfect assessment score,Ability to quickly grasp and recall technical details','Data Structures and Algorithms (DSA) for efficient problem-solving,Proficiency in a specific web development framework (e.g., Django, Flask, Spring Boot),Version Control Systems like Git for collaborative development,Practical database management skills (e.g., advanced SQL queries, schema design),Object-Oriented Programming (OOP) principles and design patterns','Your assessment results highlight a strong aptitude for programming, with demonstrated knowledge in Python, C, and backend concepts related to database-oriented languages. This foundational understanding, coupled with a perfect score, makes Software Developer an excellent fit for your strengths. While you\'ve shown a great start, developing practical skills in areas like data structures, specific web frameworks, and version control will solidify your path towards a successful career in software development.','2026-08-10 10:42:17',NULL),(4,9,100,'Software Developer',95,'Strong foundational knowledge of programming languages, with specific recognition of Python and C.,Understanding of database-oriented concepts relevant to backend system development.,High aptitude for technical subjects, demonstrated by a perfect assessment score.,Accuracy and attention to detail in answering technical questions.','Practical application of programming languages beyond historical knowledge, including syntax and problem-solving.,Mastery of core data structures and algorithms for efficient software design.,SQL proficiency and practical database interaction for application development.,Experience with version control systems like Git for collaborative coding.','Based on your excellent performance, achieving a perfect score in the assessment, you\'ve demonstrated a strong foundational aptitude for core programming concepts, including knowledge of foundational languages like Python and C, as well as an understanding of database-oriented concepts critical for backend systems. Your perfect score indicates a keen ability to grasp technical information, making you well-suited for a career as a Software Developer, particularly in roles involving backend development and system logic.','2026-08-10 10:45:14',NULL),(5,9,100,'Software Developer',92,'Strong foundational programming knowledge in languages like Python and C.,Aptitude for understanding backend development concepts, including database-oriented languages.,Excellent technical problem-solving ability, demonstrated by a perfect assessment score.','Deep understanding of Data Structures and Algorithms.,Proficiency in Object-Oriented Programming (OOP) principles and design patterns.,Practical experience with web development frameworks (e.g., Django, Flask) and APIs.,Familiarity with version control systems, specifically Git.','Based on your perfect assessment score, you\'ve demonstrated a strong foundational understanding of key programming languages like Python and C, alongside an aptitude for backend development concepts. These skills are highly relevant to a Software Developer role, indicating you have the core knowledge to excel in building robust and efficient software applications.','2026-08-10 10:46:30',NULL),(6,9,0,'Software Developer',25,'Familiarity with foundational programming languages such as Python and C, as covered in the assessment.,Exposure to backend development concepts, including database-oriented languages.,An initial engagement with core software development knowledge domains.','Proficiency in fundamental programming concepts and syntax for languages like Python and C/C++.,Understanding of core database management systems (DBMS) principles and SQL queries.,Knowledge of essential Data Structures and Algorithms.,Practical application of software development lifecycle principles.','Based on your assessment, while your current score indicates a need for significant foundational development, the questions you encountered cover core areas within software development, including basic programming concepts (Python, C) and backend/database knowledge. This suggests an initial exposure to the building blocks of software engineering. Pursuing a career as a Software Developer will allow you to build a strong foundation, mastering essential programming languages and concepts crucial for various technical roles, and provides a versatile pathway for future specialization.','2026-08-10 10:47:10',NULL),(7,9,33,'Software Developer',35,'Familiarity with foundational computer science history (specifically programming languages),Ability to recall specific technical facts within the software domain,Initial exposure to core programming language concepts (implied by engagement with C-related knowledge)','Proficiency in a modern programming language (e.g., Python or Java),Understanding of database management systems (DBMS) and SQL,Knowledge of fundamental data structures and algorithms,Introduction to software development principles and methodologies','Based on your assessment, you demonstrated a foundational awareness in the history of programming, specifically recognizing the \'father of C\'. While your overall score indicates significant areas for growth, this initial spark suggests a potential inclination towards the core principles of software development. Pursuing a career as a Software Developer would allow you to build upon this foundational knowledge and delve into the exciting world of creating technology.','2026-08-10 10:47:59',NULL),(8,4,33,'Software Developer',65,'Basic knowledge of Python\'s origin, indicating initial exposure or interest in a key programming language.,Demonstrated familiarity with the \'Software\' category of technical questions.,Awareness of \'Backend\' related concepts, even if the specific answer was incorrect.','Core C/C++ programming fundamentals and historical context.,Database management systems (DBMS) and SQL language proficiency.,Data Structures and Algorithms for efficient problem-solving.,Practical application of programming concepts in developing software.','Based on your assessment, you demonstrated a foundational awareness of Python, a critical language in modern software development. While your overall score indicates areas for growth in specific technical domains, your exposure to general software and backend concepts suggests a promising path towards becoming a Software Developer. By building upon your nascent Python knowledge and strengthening core programming principles, you can develop the necessary skills to excel in this field and pursue various specializations.','2026-08-10 10:51:39',NULL),(9,9,66,'AI Engineer',80,'Foundational understanding of Artificial Intelligence concepts, particularly in machine learning and predictive systems.,Proficiency in Python fundamentals, a critical programming language for AI development.,General software development aptitude, demonstrating an understanding of programming history and languages.,Basic awareness of database-oriented languages, useful for data handling in AI projects.','Stronger grasp of core Data Structures and Algorithms for efficient code development.,Practical application and implementation of various Machine Learning algorithms and techniques.,Proficiency in data preprocessing, feature engineering, and data cleaning for AI model preparation.,Understanding and application of Deep Learning frameworks such as TensorFlow or PyTorch.','Your assessment reveals a strong foundational aptitude for Artificial Intelligence, evidenced by your correct identification of core AI technologies and your understanding of Python, a pivotal language in the field. While there are some fundamental programming areas to enhance, your clear interest and initial knowledge in AI make the AI Engineer role a highly suitable and exciting career path. By diligently building upon these strengths and addressing identified skill gaps, you are well-positioned for a successful career in AI.','2026-08-10 11:01:50',NULL),(10,9,100,'Software Developer',92,'Strong grasp of foundational programming concepts, including data structures (e.g., LIFO principle).,Knowledge of key programming languages such as Python and C.,Understanding of database-oriented language concepts essential for backend development.,Aptitude for diverse technical domains, demonstrated by correct answers in AI and Cyber Security.','Advanced Data Structures and Algorithms for optimized problem-solving.,Proficiency in specific web development frameworks (e.g., Django, Spring Boot, Node.js).,Version Control Systems (e.g., Git) for collaborative development.,Software testing methodologies and debugging techniques.,Understanding of API design and development principles.','Your assessment results highlight a strong foundational understanding of core programming concepts, including data structures and familiarity with key languages like Python and C. Your aptitude for understanding database-oriented languages further solidifies your potential in backend development, a crucial aspect of software development. While demonstrating a broad technical awareness including AI and Cyber Security, your performance strongly indicates that a career as a Software Developer aligns perfectly with your current skill set and strong learning capacity.','2026-08-10 11:07:28',NULL);
